&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Backend Engineer, you&#39;ll design and run the Python services and APIs that keep this experience fast and reliable, including at peak times like live sports finals. You&#39;ll work on a multi-tenant, distributed platform, so scalability, efficiency and maintainability matter in every design decision. You&#39;ll also help us keep improving the platform and the way we build it.&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
