&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape our API platform.&lt;/strong&gt; Learn our multi-tenant, distributed web API infrastructure and help take it to the next level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build services that hold up under load.&lt;/strong&gt; Design, develop and deploy backend services and API gateways for high availability, low latency and scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own what you ship.&lt;/strong&gt; Your team runs its own services in production, from deployment and monitoring to on-call and incident follow-up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enable the business.&lt;/strong&gt; Build and maintain admin tools that let tenant-facing teams configure business logic for each tenant on their own.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work across disciplines.&lt;/strong&gt; Join an autonomous, cross-functional team and work closely with frontend, video and operations engineers to understand what they need from the backend.&lt;/li&gt;
