lp you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll be Doing&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lakehouse Architecture:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and implement Medallion-layer data architectures (Bronze, Silver, Gold), building structured ingestion pipelines and curated data layers that serve downstream analyti

