&lt;li&gt;Proactively build and qualify expansion pipeline within existing accounts by identifying new teams, stakeholders and use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and deliver against an expansion and renewal quota across your customer portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the full sales cycle: lead discovery, coordinate technical evaluations with Solutions Engineering, communicate value, develop proposals, negotiate commercial terms and close agreements.&lt;/li&gt;
