&lt;p&gt;Help CIOs, CISOs, and CTOs see how Cribl can turn complex telemetry, observability, and security challenges into measurable business value whilst earning the confidence of an enterprise architect through your technical depth and consultative approach.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll partner directly with Account Executives throughout complex sales cycles, from discovery and solution design through proof of value and close. You’ll design and configure solutions by working with real customer data and demonstrating how Cribl can help customers improve operational and security outcomes. Your work will span the AI Platform for Telemetry, helping customers build a flexible data foundation for observability, security, and AI-driven operations rather than limiting them to a single tool or use case.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As An Active Member Of Our Team, You Will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
