&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a commercially minded, hands-on Senior Human Resources Manager to lead all People &amp;amp; Culture functions at our Australian fulfillment center. Serving as the dedicated HR Business Partner to the Site Director, you will own the end-to-end people strategy, workforce capability, and daily HR operations for a large, multi-shift frontline and salaried workforce.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Operating within a matrixed People model, you will manage an on-site HR team while partnering closely with our specialised Centres of Excellence (COEs)—including Talent Acquisition, Total Rewards, People Operations, and Work Health &amp;amp; Safety (WHS)—to translate people initiatives into practical, high-impact site execution.&lt;/p&gt;
